                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Project communications calendar/plan: PM13 Communications Calendar Template
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Project lessons learned: PM25 Lessons Learned Template
                    &lt;/li&gt;
                    &lt;li&gt;
                        Project scorecard: This document is not a core deliverable as the use of it varies by project. It
                        is utilized for reporting status for a program with multiple projects, or a project with multiple
